    "updated_at": "2026-05-24T15:48:40Z",
    "body": "I see @tharkum [added more tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/commit/71a2257ed707e04a791207b2fc40dbeee2e53a89) in this area some time ago, but the section cited in OP is non-normative. I cannot find a normative requirement for resetting the origin-clean flag. I do agree it seems like the sensible thing to do, but we do have to actually define it.\n\ncc @whatwg/canvas ",
